From d861a01bf5fe9960ad47d1e016534aebd8d95d4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DrakeRamorayJr <179530612+DrakeRamorayJr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:06:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bare: give the sheet new-tab button breathing room and match
 the toolbar surface

In bottom-bar Sheet mode, raise the bottom seam to 12dp, size the actions
row buttons to 48dp with 16dp bottom padding (28dp total clearance above
the bottom toolbar with non-overlapping touch targets), paint the seam and
bottom toolbar to match the sheet's opaque surface while open, and restore
the toolbar drawable on close. Top-bar Sheet mode and the side drawer are
unchanged.
